OL,3,ABooker Prize judges reveal shortlisted
OL,4,Anovels after selection 'tussle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPast Booker Prize winners Marlon James
OL,7,Fand Douglas Stuart have been
OL,8,Fshortlisted for the prestigious
OL,9,Fliterary award again, after a selection
OL,10,Fprocess that the judges described as "a
OL,11,Ftussle".
OL,13,FJamaican writer James is nominated this
OL,14,Fyear for his latest novel The
OL,15,FDisappearers; while Scottish author
OL,16,FStuart is shortlisted for John of John.
OL,18,FThis year's other contenders are
OL,19,Faward-winning US novelist Elizabeth
OL,20,FStrout, and British authors M John
OL,21,FHarrison, Luke Kennard and Rebecca
OL,22,FPerry.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
